# KAYDARAP does NOT need any secret to build or run.
# The site is fully static and the admin panel (/admin) signs in with GitHub.
#
# Only if you later enable "Sign in with GitHub" (OAuth) for the CMS instead of
# a personal access token, you deploy the small sveltia-cms-auth Cloudflare Worker.
# Those values live in the WORKER's settings (Cloudflare dashboard), never in this repo:
#
#   GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
#   GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
#   ALLOWED_DOMAINS=www.kaydarap.com
#
# Then put the worker URL (not a secret) into public/admin/config.yml → backend.base_url
